        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somerset%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Somerset once served as a supplier of bootlegged alcohol to the twin cities of Saint Paul and Minneapolis.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somerset%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The hilly terrain of Somerset is dotted with ponds, sloughs, and bogs that were ideal for producing cranberries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
